@baseUrl = http://localhost:5111

### Process a simulated payment
# @name processPayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "a6fbc50d-e6bd-4a8f-b635-e37f7a01dd11",
  "amount": 299.00,
  "currency": "SEK"
}

### Retrieve the payment created above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/{{processPayment.response.body.$.paymentId}}

### Recover the result after an HTTP timeout before retrying POST
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/by-booking/a6fbc50d-e6bd-4a8f-b635-e37f7a01dd11

### Compensate a late payment (idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/{{processPayment.response.body.$.paymentId}}/refund

### Cancel by booking even when the original POST result is unknown
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "a6fbc50d-e6bd-4a8f-b635-e37f7a01dd11",
  "amount": 299.00,
  "currency": "SEK"
}

### Verify a missing payment returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
